1175:     Write-Host "come back  : codex-consult.ps1 -Task $Task$collabOpt -Status -Id $($paths.Id8) (exit 0 done and usable, 1 a failure, 2 still running); -Wait -Id $($paths.Id8) waits until it is done (default: its budget, $Budget s)"
