409: # The verdict on one detached run (D5, D6, D11): { State; Exit; Text; Finished; Of }
410: #   done           the run ended: Exit 0 when its exit was 0, else 1
411: #   running        not done, its background (pid + start time, on this host) is alive: Exit 2
412: #   elsewhere      not done, its background runs on another host: liveness cannot be checked
413: #                  from here and is never judged: Exit 2
414: #   starting       written by the foreground (no pid yet) less than 60 s ago: Exit 2
415: #   died           not done, and its background is gone: Exit 1 (its recovery records are
416: #                  judged by the next run of the task as usual)
417: #   never-started  still `starting` without a pid after 60 s: Exit 1
418: #   unreadable     the status file cannot be used ($Problem): Exit 1
